# US-112267 — Detailed Analysis
**Title:** TAR Billing Files — Disbursements Tab — Foundation & ELD Simple Layout
**Module:** Tax Amount Reports → Tax/TaxAmountReports/TaxAmtDisbursement
**API Path:** Classic TAX API remoting (`TAXClassicAPI`)
**Date:** 2026-08-03

---

## 1. Overview

Adds a **Billing File** export to the TAR Disbursements tab in LeretanetCore. The feature is gated by `LDBillingFilesInd = 'Y'` in `LASCommon.dbo.lac_CustomerProfile`. When eligible, the user can click a **Billing File** button to download a plain-text fixed-width `.txt` file containing one row per reported item in the selected TAR job (LoanId, TaxId, AmountToPay, NextELDDate). The four in-scope customers are `1085`, `1090`, `1096`, and `2132`.

The export follows the Classic TAX API remoting path (same as `GetExportPayItems`) — `RequestHelper.PostData` → `TAXClassicAPI` → BLL/DAL dispatcher.

