## 14. Edge Cases

| Case | Handling |
|---|---|
| Customer has no rows in `tbl_cta_ReportedItems` for the run | Empty file downloaded (0 rows, valid `.txt`) |
| `NextELDDate` is NULL | 6 spaces written in ELD date position |
| `AmountToPay` is NULL or 0 | `0` written right-justified in amount position |
| `LoanId` exceeds 10 chars | Truncated to 10 chars (left) |
| `TaxId` exceeds 25 chars | Truncated to 25 chars (left) |
| `LDBillingFilesInd` is NULL, space, or any value other than `'Y'` | Button hidden |
| Session expired before export click | Error returned, consistent with existing export behaviour |
| `DROPPED = 'Y'` rows | Excluded from the file |

